<title>GREECE: BANK OF ATTICA OFFERS FOREX DEPOSIT ACCOUNTS.</title>
<headline>BANK OF ATTICA OFFERS FOREX DEPOSIT ACCOUNTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Attica said on Friday it launched deposit accounts in foreign currency for permanent residents as well as corporations domiciled in Greece following the recent lifting of controls by the Bank of Greece.</p>
<p>Clients may open the new accounts either converting drachmas into foreign currency or directly depositing foreign currency banknotes, it said.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
